  "name": "Presence of the Arbiter",
  "type": "ability",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/Arbiter_Path_Icon.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Range:</strong> Self</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> 5-space-radius</p><p>You project an aura of calm and surety to your allies, and one of fear and menace to your enemies.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, you and any allies within <strong>5 spaces</strong> of you are immune to being <strong>Charmed</strong> or <strong>Frightened</strong>. Any allies that are currently <strong>Charmed</strong> or <strong>Frightened</strong> immediately recover from those conditions.</p><p>Additionally, make a <strong>4:1 Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check. Until the start of your next turn, any enemy that moves within <strong>5 spaces</strong> of you must make an opposed <strong>Willpower</strong> check or become <strong>Frightened</strong> of you until the start of your next turn. Any enemies already within <strong>5 spaces</strong> of you must immediately make this check.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.2Hxqkq8h2eQZyYnh]{Presence of the Arbiter}</p>",
